z y z], or [x y z]&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Homogeneous Transformation (TForm): [4x4] matrix&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Quaternion (Quat): [w x y z]&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Rotation Matrix (RotM): [3x3] matrix&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Translation Vector (TrVec): [x y z]&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Set the desired Representation parameter for both the Input and Output coordinate transformations. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;!-- convert transform transform conversion convert coordinates coordinate conversion convert coordinate transformations coordinate transformation conversion axang2quat axang2rotm axang2tform axis angle   axisangle   axangle eul2quat eul2rotm eul2tform euler ZYX   euler ZYZ   euler XYZ quat2axang quat2eul quat2rotm quat2tform rotm2axang rotm2eul rotm2quat rotm2tform tform2axang tform2eul tform2quat tform2rotm tform2trvec trvec2tform homogeneous transformation matrix --&gt;</block_desc><block_path>$bdroot/Utilities/Coordinate Transformation Conversion</block_path><block_open>$bdroot/Utilities/Coordinate Transformation Conversion</block_open><block_isNotLeafBlk>0</block_isNotLeafBlk><block_position>275  210  425  290</block_position><block_icon>Utilities/Coordinate@20@Transformation@20@Conversion.svg</block_icon><keywords></keywords><port_domains>signal.in_signal:1,signal.out_signal:1</port_domains><block_type>MATLABSystem</block_type><block_reference>robotcorelib/Coordinate Transformation Conversion</block_reference></block_node></block_node></library>